  "body": "Street Frontage | Panoramic Sea Views | Private Lift | Top-Tier Miele Kitchen\r\n\r\nThe Ultimate Configuration:\r\n• Generous Space: Land area 212m², Floor area 244m², spanning three impeccably designed levels.\r\n• 5 Bedrooms | 3.5 Bathrooms: * Ground Floor Convenience: One bedroom is perfectly positioned on the ground floor—ideal for elderly family members, guests, or a home office.\r\n• Luxury Bathing: Includes a master ensuite, two additional independent bathrooms, plus a separate guest powder room (3.5 bathrooms in total).\r\n• Premium Infrastructure:\r\n• Private Internal Lift: A rare and prestigious feature in the area, providing seamless access across all three levels.\r\n• Miele Chef’s Kitchen: Fully equipped with top-of-the-line Miele appliances, where luxury meets functionality.\r\n• Iconic Views: Situated in the prime street-front position. Massive floor-to-ceiling windows capture breathtaking, unobstructed sea views from the comfort of your living room.\r\n• Exceptional Parking: A spacious Double Garage, plus additional onsite parking for 2 more cars (4 parking spaces in total)—a significant advantage for street-front living.\r\n\r\nUnbeatable Location:\r\n• World-Class Schooling: In-zone for the prestigious Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Intermediate (BBI), and Bucklands Beach Primary.\r\n• Coastal Lifestyle: A short stroll to the beach and a few minutes’ drive to the Half Moon Bay Marina for ferry services directly to Auckland CBD.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
